1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,620
(Amy:)Kiss me
where I've never been kissed before.

2
00:00:05,454 --> 00:00:07,794
You mean like SaIt Lake City?

3
00:00:10,251 --> 00:00:11,751
(Amy:)Never mind. I'll talk to Penny.

4
00:00:11,919 --> 00:00:13,379
(Howard:)Thank you.

5
00:00:13,546 --> 00:00:15,376
(Amy:)Will you listen to me
play my harp now?

6
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:18,258
(Sheldon:)No. I dislike the sound of the harp.

7
00:00:18,426 --> 00:00:21,466
(Sheldon:)Its overuse
in classic television sitcoms...

8
00:00:21,637 --> 00:00:25,437
(Sheldon:)...always makes me think I'm going
to experience an episode from my past.

9
00:00:26,559 --> 00:00:29,649
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, Mommy. Don't be mad at me.
Don't do that.

10
00:00:33,482 --> 00:00:35,022
(Leonard:)I don't know about this, Howard.

11
00:00:35,192 --> 00:00:38,572
(Howard:)What? You're having trouble
with the long-distance love-making.

12
00:00:38,738 --> 00:00:39,948
(Howard:)This is your answer.

13
00:00:40,114 --> 00:00:43,614
(Howard:)There are two interfaces
that simulate a human mouth.

14
00:00:43,784 --> 00:00:47,534
(Howard:)You have one, Priya has one in India.
When you move your Iips and tongue...

15
00:00:47,705 --> 00:01:00,025
(Howard:)...it transmits exactly
what you're doing to hers.

